Recommends: citos-icons
Conflicts: citos-desktop
Description: CIT-OS Desktop: KDE Plasma 6 in the CIT-OS Horizon look
 A modern desktop for CIT-OS: KDE Plasma 6 on X11 with a slim top bar (menu,
 the app's own menu, tray, clock) and a floating dock, the CIT-OS Horizon
 colours (navy, cyan and blue), WhiteSur app icons (citos-icons; Papirus
 as the fallback), Inter and JetBrains Mono,
 a CIT-OS sign-in screen (SDDM) and splash, the CIT-OS boot splash
 (Plymouth), Firefox ESR with CIT-OS's home page and bookmarks, and xrdp
 for Remote Desktop. Defaults only: each person can change them.
